  "section_notes": "The final S2 removes any automatic sales bar above 5% and withholds per-model rates from the public, which protects Northwind's Hearth 10 at 6.2%. S5 applies the 8-per-100,000 model-specific mandatory recall trigger, which Halcyon's Ember 8 (9.9) exceeds, so Halcyon carries the main operational cost. S1's reporting scope excludes minor overheating events, which the answer key treats as a weakening."
